The root cause is now concrete: this launcher’s PID namespace reports a process ID that is absent from the mounted `/proc`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`. `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m applying a narrowly scoped, audit-local compatibility shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean inputs, source, elaboration, or proof checking.
